  "description": "Hyunwoo, his twin brother, was the most important person in Yeonwoo’s life. He already wasn’t happy about the sudden marriage, but to marry a guy who’s only got good looks, a cocky attitude, and money? There’s no way he could ever support this marriage...! But before he had a chance to object, the two rushed into marriage. Because of this, Yeonwoo constantly wished for his brother’s divorce. Then one day, Yeonwoo got a call from his brother-in-law, the thorn in his side. Worried about his brother, he reluctantly visited their newlywed home. And there, Yeonwoo ended up crossing a line with his brother-in-law... Can Yeonwoo still maintain a peaceful family after this?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/aoqn), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/share_the_maebu), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000071359), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12911334), [Postype](https://www.postype.com/@kidaristudio/series/1508594)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/share_the_brother_in_law), [Lezhin](https://lezhin.jp/comic/share_the_brother_in_law)  \nOthers: [Thai](https://www.lezhinth.com/detail/sharing), [T.Chinese](https://www.bomtoon.tw/detail/aoqn)\n\n*Note: The T.Chinese version is uncensored.*",
